{
  "id": "eb-games",
  "name": "EB Games",
  "category": "retailer_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "The cards EB Games gave away with Pokémon TCG purchases, mostly the same ones GameStop gave. Heatran with the Ultra Prism logo, from 2 to 28 February 2018, and Zygarde and Groudon with the Year of Legendary Pokémon logo came from both chains. Most of the others carry EB Games' own logo on the picture, in two versions for some cards: one with a red maple leaf for Canada and one for Australia and New Zealand, as for Duraludon at the launch of Evolving Skies on 27 August 2021, Flapple and Sandaconda.\n\nOthers include Hisuian Zoroark from 9 September 2022, Teal Mask Ogerpon from 24 May 2024, Archaludon from 13 September 2024 and Yveltal from 26 September 2025, and for the 30th anniversary of Pokémon EB Games in Canada and Australia gave Zarude with the \"What's Your Favorite?\" logo.",
    "sources": [
